@startuml offering-value-stream-boundary
title Offering / Value Stream Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 6

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Value Stream" as VS
class "Offering" as O

VS --> O : involves
O -[dotted]- VS : is NOT
VS -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 6:
  Value Stream involves Offering. An Offering participates in
  a Value Stream, but an Offering is NOT a Value Stream.
end note

@enduml
